stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> imported

    imported --> needs_context
    imported --> ready_for_draft
    imported --> excluded
    imported --> do_not_contact

    needs_context --> ready_for_draft
    needs_context --> excluded
    needs_context --> do_not_contact

    ready_for_draft --> draft_ready
    ready_for_draft --> needs_context

    draft_ready --> approved
    draft_ready --> ready_for_draft

    approved --> sending_initial
    approved --> draft_ready

    sending_initial --> sent_initial
    sending_initial --> approved : safe pre-click failure

    sent_initial --> followup_due
    sent_initial --> replied
    sent_initial --> meeting_booked
    sent_initial --> not_interested
    sent_initial --> completed

    followup_due --> sending_followup
    followup_due --> replied
    followup_due --> meeting_booked
    followup_due --> not_interested
    followup_due --> completed

    sending_followup --> sent_followup
    sending_followup --> followup_due : safe pre-click failure

    sent_followup --> replied
    sent_followup --> no_response
    sent_followup --> meeting_booked
    sent_followup --> not_interested
    sent_followup --> completed

    replied --> meeting_booked
    replied --> not_interested
    replied --> completed

    no_response --> completed
    no_response --> do_not_contact

    meeting_booked --> [*]
    not_interested --> [*]
    do_not_contact --> [*]
    completed --> [*]
    excluded --> [*]

    note right of error
        Any non-terminal status can
        transition to error, and error
        can recover to almost any status
        after manual review. Omitted here
        for readability.
    end note
